{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Star Trek Adventures: Discovery Season 1 Player Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Fantasy Grounds adaptation contains player character statistics for the crew of the <i>U.S.S. Discovery</i> NCC-1031 as seen in Season 1 of Star Trek: Discovery. The module includes Pre-Generated Characters and NPC records for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Captain Gabriel Lorca</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Commander Saru</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lieutenant Paul Stamets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lieutenant Commander Hugh Culber</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Michael Burnham</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lieutenant Ash Tyler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cadet Sylvia Tilly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emperor Philippa Georgiou</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">L'Rell</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pack also contains game statistics for the <i>U.S.S. Discovery</i> NCC-1031, game rules for Kelpiens as playable character species, and statistics and NPC records for several supporting characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong><i>Star Trek Adventures</i> </strong>core rulebook is required to use these characters and rules in play.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652090?t=1745335966","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652090?t=1745335966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652090/346725bb0d4233d82019d621b7b19e50ec6ce450/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745335966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652090/346725bb0d4233d82019d621b7b19e50ec6ce450/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745335966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Onli